<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">

<%- include('components/common/_head', { description: "ハンドメイド猫グッズのお店 l'atelier Queue のホームページです。" }) %>


<body class="top">

<header class="topHeader">
  <div class="topHeader__inner">

    <h1 class="topHeader__heading">
      <img class="topHeader__logo" src="../images/common/logo_top_header.svg" alt="ハンドメイド猫グッズのお店 -nekonokomono- l'atelier Queue（アトリエ・クー）">
    </h1>

    <p class="topHeader__text">
      “Queue(クー)”は、フランス語で「しっぽ」の意味です。<br>
      猫にも人にも心地好いをモットーに、猫おもちゃ、雑貨を作っています。
    </p>

  </div><!-- /.topHeader_inner.l-lg-container -->

  <div class="topHeader__image"></div>

  <%- include('components/common/_gnav') %>
</header>


<main>

  <div class="l-lg-container">

    <section class="primarySection">
      <header class="primarySection__heading lv2Heading lv2Heading--icon lv2Heading--link">
        <h2 class="lv2Heading__title">
          お知らせ
        </h2>

        <a class="lv2Heading__link primaryLink" href="#">一覧へ</a>
      </header><!-- /.primarySection__heading.lv2Heading -->

      <dl class="primarySection__list newsList">
        <dt class="newsList__date"><time datetime="2021-11-01">2021-11-01</time></dt>

        <dd class="newsList__text">
          <span class="newsList__tag primaryTag --new">新商品情報</span>
          <a class="newsList__link" href="#">【焼印付】爪とぎ型キーホルダー登場！</a>
        </dd>

        <dt class="newsList__date"><time datetime="2021-10-28">2021-10-28</time></dt>

        <dd class="newsList__text">
          <span class="newsList__tag primaryTag">入荷情報</span>
          <a class="newsList__link" href="#">里親募集型猫カフェ猫式さんの委託販売ブースにアクセサリー・猫首輪・けりぐるみを納品しました。</a>
        </dd>

        <dt class="newsList__date"><time datetime="2021-10-12">2021-10-12</time></dt>

        <dd class="newsList__text">
          <span class="newsList__tag primaryTag">イベント出店</span>
          <a class="newsList__link" href="#">【ニャンフェス14に参加決定。鋭意新作製作中です！</a>
        </dd>
      </dl>
    </section>


    <section class="primarySection">
      <header class="primarySection__heading lv2Heading lv2Heading--icon lv2Heading--link">
        <h2 class="lv2Heading__title">
          おすすめ商品
        </h2>
      </header><!-- /.primarySection__heading.lv2Heading -->

      <ul class="primarySection__list grid grid--pc3col">
        <li class="grid__item grid__item--productCard productCard">
          <h3 class="productCard__heading">【焼印付】爪とぎ型キーホルダー</h3>

          <figure class="productCard__figure">
            <img class="productCard__image" src="../images/products/dmy_pd001.jpg" alt="" width="750" height="750">
          </figure>

          <p class="productCard__text">可愛らしいミニチュアサイズの「猫の爪とぎ」型キーホルダー。木製ケースの裏面には猫シルエットの焼印付きでオシャレ！</p>

          <p class="productCard__price">
            <span class="productCard__priceYen">000円</span>(税抜)
          </p>

          <a class="productCard__link primaryBtn --sm --rightArrow" href="#" aria-label="〜の詳細を見る">詳細を見る</a>

          <div class="productCard__ribbon">新商品</div>
        </li>

        <li class="grid__item grid__item--productCard productCard">
          <h3 class="productCard__heading">肉球ブローチ（7個セット）</h3>

          <figure class="productCard__figure">
            <img class="productCard__image" src="../images/products/dmy_pd002.jpg" alt="" width="750" height="750">
          </figure>

          <p class="productCard__text">定番の肉球型のレジンブローチ（7個セット）です。</p>

          <p class="productCard__price">
            <span class="productCard__priceYen">000円</span>(税抜)
          </p>

          <a class="productCard__link primaryBtn --sm --rightArrow" href="#" aria-label="〜の詳細を見る">詳細を見る</a>
        </li>

        <li class="grid__item grid__item--productCard productCard">
          <h3 class="productCard__heading">レース猫首輪（鈴付き）</h3>

          <figure class="productCard__figure">
            <img class="productCard__image" src="../images/products/dmy_pd003.jpg" alt="" width="750" height="750">
          </figure>

          <p class="productCard__text">アースカラーのレース＋アンティーク調の金具でシックな印象の猫首輪です。</p>

          <p class="productCard__price">
            <span class="productCard__priceYen">000円</span>(税抜)
          </p>

          <a class="productCard__link primaryBtn --sm --rightArrow" href="#" aria-label="〜の詳細を見る">詳細を見る</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>


    <section class="primarySection">
      <header class="primarySection__heading lv2Heading lv2Heading--icon lv2Heading--link">
        <h2 class="lv2Heading__title">
          商品カテゴリー
        </h2>
      </header><!-- /.primarySection__heading.lv2Heading -->

      <ul class="primarySection__list grid grid--pc3col">
        <li class="grid__item productMedia">
          <a class="productMedia__link">
            <h3 class="productMedia__heading">レジンブローチ</h3>

            <figure class="productMedia__figure">
              <img class="productMedia__image" src="../images/products/category1.jpg" alt="" width="240" height="240" loading="lazy">
            </figure>
          </a>
        </li>

        <li class="grid__item productMedia">
          <a class="productMedia__link">
            <h3 class="productMedia__heading">猫用首輪</h3>

            <figure class="productMedia__figure">
              <img class="productMedia__image" src="../images/products/category2.jpg" alt="" width="240" height="240" loading="lazy">
            </figure>
          </a>
        </li>

        <li class="grid__item productMedia">
          <a class="productMedia__link">
            <h3 class="productMedia__heading">けりぐるみ</h3>

            <figure class="productMedia__figure">
              <img class="productMedia__image" src="../images/products/category3.jpg" alt="" width="240" height="240" loading="lazy">
            </figure>
          </a>
        </li>

        <li class="grid__item productMedia">
          <a class="productMedia__link">
            <h3 class="productMedia__heading">アクセサリー</h3>

            <figure class="productMedia__figure">
              <img class="productMedia__image" src="../images/products/category4.jpg" alt="" width="240" height="240" loading="lazy">
            </figure>
          </a>
        </li>

        <li class="grid__item productMedia">
          <a class="productMedia__link">
            <h3 class="productMedia__heading">その他雑貨</h3>

            <figure class="productMedia__figure">
              <img class="productMedia__image" src="../images/products/category5.jpg" alt="" width="240" height="240" loading="lazy">
            </figure>
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>


    <section class="shopsSection">
      <h2 class="shopsSection__heading">委託販売先</h2>

      <p class="shopsSection__lead">
        当店は現在以下の3店舗のレンタルボックスにて委託販売をさせていただいております。<br>
        商品を実際に手にとってお確かめいただけますので、お近くの方はお気軽にお立ち寄り下さい。
      </p>

      <div class="shopsSection__list">
        <section class="shopAlternate">
          <div class="shopAlternate__body">
            <h3 class="shopAlternate__heading">台湾スイーツ豆花専門 黒猫豆花 様</h3>

            <address class="shopAlternate__address">
              <dl class="shopAlternate__addressList">
                <dt class="shopAlternate__addressTerm">住所</dt>
                <dd class="shopAlternate__addressDesc">神奈川県川崎市高津区二子2丁目7-40　フォーレスト多摩川102</dd>

                <dt class="shopAlternate__addressTerm">営業時間</dt>
                <dd class="shopAlternate__addressDesc">10:00-21:00（時短営業中は20:00まで）</dd>

                <dt class="shopAlternate__addressTerm">定休日</dt>
                <dd class="shopAlternate__addressDesc">水曜日</dd>

                <dt class="shopAlternate__addressTerm">website</dt>
                <dd class="shopAlternate__addressDesc"><a class="shopAlternate__addressLink" href="https://kuroneko-douhua.com/" target="_blank">https://kuroneko-douhua.com/</a></dd>
              </dl>
            </address>
          </div><!-- /.shopAlternate__body -->

          <figure class="shopAlternate__figure">
            <img class="shopAlternate__image" src="../images/shops/shop1.jpg" alt="" width="880" height="606" loading="lazy">
          </figure>
        </section>

        <section class="shopAlternate">
          <div class="shopAlternate__body">
            <h3 class="shopAlternate__heading">May’s Cafe -ハンドメイド雑貨＆CAFE-  様</h3>

            <address class="shopAlternate__address">
              <dl class="shopAlternate__addressList">
                <dt class="shopAlternate__addressTerm">住所</dt>
                <dd class="shopAlternate__addressDesc">東京都世田谷区太子堂5-17-20-1F</dd>

                <dt class="shopAlternate__addressTerm">営業時間</dt>
                <dd class="shopAlternate__addressDesc">土日祝日11:00〜19:00のみ営業中</dd>

                <dt class="shopAlternate__addressTerm">定休日</dt>
                <dd class="shopAlternate__addressDesc">月〜金曜日</dd>

                <dt class="shopAlternate__addressTerm">Instagram</dt>
                <dd class="shopAlternate__addressDesc"><a class="shopAlternate__addressLink" href="https://www.instagram.com/mays._.cafe/" target="_blank">https://www.instagram.com/mays._.cafe/</a></dd>
              </dl>
            </address>
          </div><!-- /.shopAlternate__body -->

          <figure class="shopAlternate__figure">
            <img class="shopAlternate__image" src="../images/shops/shop2.jpg" alt="" width="880" height="606" loading="lazy">
          </figure>
        </section>

        <section class="shopAlternate">
          <div class="shopAlternate__body">
            <h3 class="shopAlternate__heading">里親募集型猫カフェ 猫式 様</h3>

            <address class="shopAlternate__address">
              <dl class="shopAlternate__addressList">
                <dt class="shopAlternate__addressTerm">住所</dt>
                <dd class="shopAlternate__addressDesc">神奈川県川崎市高津区溝口1－20－10　東方ビル3F</dd>

                <dt class="shopAlternate__addressTerm">営業時間</dt>
                <dd class="shopAlternate__addressDesc">12：00～20：00（最終受付19:30）</dd>

                <dt class="shopAlternate__addressTerm">定休日</dt>
                <dd class="shopAlternate__addressDesc">月曜日</dd>

                <dt class="shopAlternate__addressTerm">website</dt>
                <dd class="shopAlternate__addressDesc"><a class="shopAlternate__addressLink" href="https://www.neko-shiki.net/" target="_blank">https://www.neko-shiki.net/</a></dd>
              </dl>
            </address>
          </div><!-- /.shopAlternate__body -->

          <figure class="shopAlternate__figure">
            <img class="shopAlternate__image" src="../images/shops/shop3.jpg" alt="" width="880" height="606" loading="lazy">
          </figure>
        </section>
      </div><!-- /.shopSection__list -->
    </section>


    <%- include('components/other/_profile') %>

  </div><!-- /.l-lg-container -->

</main>


<%- include('components/common/_footer', { path: '../', className: 'u-mt0' }) %>




</body>
</html>
